From 33bf08a746bd64306e0375f8d419af4744d31064 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 15:59:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(storage): restore snapshots before workload startup

Import bounded regular-file and directory snapshots into the prepared
owned filesystem before any workload executes. Restore bytes, permission
bits and long names with checked archive and assignment boundaries.
Discard the new memory view on import failure and retain the source file.

Signed-off-by: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
